stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> PendingConfirmation: O1 checkout submitted
  PendingConfirmation --> Confirmed: O2 payment verified / COD confirmed / transfer verified
  PendingConfirmation --> ReviewRequired: O3 ambiguous or late payment
  PendingConfirmation --> Cancelled: O4 failed, expired or abandoned
  ReviewRequired --> Confirmed: O5 payment, stock and slot reconciled
  ReviewRequired --> Cancelled: O6 payment failed or cannot fulfil
  Confirmed --> Packing: O7 packing batch starts
  Confirmed --> Cancelled: O8 cancelled before packing
  Packing --> Packed: O9 every line packed or resolved
  Packing --> Cancelled: O10 nothing can be fulfilled
  Packed --> OutForDelivery: O11 dispatched
  OutForDelivery --> Delivered: O12 delivery confirmed
  OutForDelivery --> DeliveryFailed: O13 attempt failed
  DeliveryFailed --> OutForDelivery: O14 re-attempt in agreed slot
  DeliveryFailed --> Returned: O15 no re-attempt, goods back at hub
  Delivered --> [*]
  Returned --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
